    "semantic_summary": "BoundingBoxGizmo is a presentation layer component responsible for visualizing the wireframe of a 3D bounding box within the scene editor. It translates the mathematical properties of a BoundingBox object into visible lines using the RendererBehaviour. Its core logic involves calculating the eight corner points and drawing the twelve connecting edges, optionally applying spacing for visual padding."
